<title>SOUTH KOREA: Han Joo denies rumours on affiliates.</title>
<headline>Han Joo denies rumours on affiliates.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's garment importer and distributor Han Joo Corp on Wednesday denied rumours that Hanjoo Chemical Co and another of its affiliates had defaulted on debt payments.  </p>
<p>&quot;We notify that debt default rumours on our affiliates Hanjoo Chemical and Hanjoo Paper Co are groundless,&quot; Han Joo said in a statement to the Korea Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Despite the denial, Han Joo shares went limit down to 4,830 won, losing 410 won in the early afternoon session.</p>
<p>Hanjoo Chemical shares were flat at 1,220 won.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
